  172: push_constant_string "Carrion jadinko"
  173: pop_string_local 0
  174: push_constant_string "The carrion jadinko is probably the least pleasant of the jadinko species. They scavenge on the leftovers of other creatures and feast cannibalistically on the remains of other hunted jadinkos. The vines that these creatures produce are particularly pungent and rot rather nicely to create supercompost."
  175: pop_string_local 1
  176: push_constant_string "To attract carrion jadinkos:"
  177: push_constant_string "<br>"
  178: push_constant_string "<br>"
  179: push_constant_string "grow a kalferberry bush, a green vine flower and build a boneyard."
  180: join_string 4
  181: pop_string_local 2
