  210: push_constant_string "Draconic jadinko"
  211: pop_string_local 0
  212: push_constant_string "While not dragons, these rare and elusive creatures certainly resemble them. They are powerful beasts with a deep connection to the earth: so deep that their vines can be used to create powerful potions that attracts the mining spirits of stone."
  213: push_constant_string "<br>"
  214: push_constant_string "<br>"
  215: push_constant_string "These jadinkos are caught with marasamaw plants."
  216: join_string 4
  217: pop_string_local 1
  218: push_constant_string "To attract draconic jadinkos:"
  219: push_constant_string "<br>"
  220: push_constant_string "<br>"
  221: push_constant_string "grow a lergberry bush, a red vine flower and build a dark pit. In addition you will need to be under the influence of the juju hunter potion."
